  warm conversation with friends and neighbors. What to bring: We’ll prov
 ide the sandwiches. Please bring a drink\, dessert\, or side dish to share
 . Where: For December 14th\, enter the small chapel room at the east side 
 of Lancaster Friends School. We hope you can join us! The Lancaster Townsh
 ip Dem
